        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Collection 5025 Knob With 5048 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis solid brass egg knobset made by Baldwin has a simple design that makes it perfect for almost any style home. This knobset will fit a 1-3/8 inch thick door with a 2-3/8 inch backset. Concealed mounting means that the sleek look is not interrupted by unsightly screws; and because it is made by Baldwin out of solid brass, you know that it is made with attention to both style and quality.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 5025 Egg Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" standard door preparation.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>28 degree latch rotation</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolts springs.</li>\r\n<li>Latches are reversible for all door conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Latches include standard full lip strike.</li>\r\n<li>Latches include anti-friction insert for smooth operation</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Solid Brass Egg Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button located on rose. An emergency release function allows the knob to automatically unlock when it is turned from the inside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Egg Knobset, Baldwin 5025",
                "description": "Baldwin Estates Collection 5025 Knob with 5048 Rosette - This solid brass egg knobset made by Baldwin has a simple design that makes it perfect for almost any style home. This knobset will fit a 1-3/8 inch thick door with a 2-3/8 inch backset. Concealed mounting means that the sleek look is not interrupted by unsightly screws; and because it is made by Baldwin out of solid brass, you know that it is made with attention to both style and quality.",
